---
import { site } from "../data/site";
import Prose from "../layouts/prose.astro";

// TODO: draft policy. Have it reviewed by a lawyer before launch.
---

<Prose
	title="Privacy policy"
	description={`How ${site.name} collects, uses and protects your personal data.`}
	updated={new Date("2026-09-24")}
>
	<blockquote>
		<p>This policy is a draft and is being reviewed before cohort enrollment opens online.</p>
	</blockquote>

	<p>
		{site.name} is operated by {site.company} ("we", "us"). This policy explains
		what personal data we collect when you visit {site.url.replace("https://", "")} or join a cohort, why we collect it and what rights you have.
	</p>

	<h2>What we collect</h2>
	<ul>
		<li><strong>Application details</strong>: your name, email address, time zone, chosen role and anything you tell us about your company.</li>
		<li><strong>Enrollment and payment records</strong>: which cohort and plan you're on. Card payments are processed by our payment provider; we never see or store full card numbers.</li>
		<li><strong>Program activity</strong>: your code, pull requests, messages and session recordings created during a cohort.</li>
		<li><strong>Website data</strong>: basic server logs. We don't use advertising or tracking cookies.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>How we use it</h2>
	<ul>
		<li>To review your application and match you with a team.</li>
		<li>To run the cohort: classes, code review, recordings and demo day.</li>
		<li>To take payments and keep the records the law requires.</li>
		<li>To email you about your cohort and, if you agree, future cohorts. You can unsubscribe at any time.</li>
	</ul>

	<h2>Who we share it with</h2>
	<p>
		Your team and instructors see your program activity. We use service
		providers for hosting, email, video and payments, who process data only on
		our instructions. We never sell personal data.
	</p>

	<h2>How long we keep it</h2>
	<p>
		We keep application data for 12 months if you don't enroll, and enrollment
		and payment records for as long as the law requires. Recordings stay
		available to alumni for the life of the program.
	</p>

	<h2>Your rights</h2>
	<p>
		You can ask to see, correct, export or delete your personal data, or object
		to how we use it. Email <a href={`mailto:${site.email}`}>{site.email}</a> and
		we'll respond within 30 days.
	</p>

	<h2>Changes</h2>
	<p>
		If we change this policy in a way that affects you, we'll email you before
		the change takes effect.
	</p>
</Prose>
